[{"id":"skill:codestable:browser-bridge","name":"Browser Bridge","slug":"browser-bridge","kind":"skill","summary":"通过 Chrome 扩展控制真实浏览器。需要访问网页、抽取网页数据、点击按钮、填写表单、执行浏览器自动化、提取渲染后的组件证据，或以程序方式操作页面时使用。通过 DOM diff、简化 HTML 和 component evidence pack 返回节省 token 的结构化结果。适用于 browser control、web automation、page scraping、web data extraction、execute JS in browser、web_scan、web_execute_js、open browser、navigate to URL、get page content、fill form、click button、extract component、rendered DOM、computed styles、component evidence。","category":"Agent Skills","publisher":{"name":"codestable","verified":false,"provenance":"awesome-list-claim","url":"https://www.skills.sh/codestable/codestable/browser-bridge"},"stars":null,"version":null,"skillSource":"https://www.skills.sh/codestable/codestable/browser-bridge","installability":"discovery_only","source":"feed:skills-sh","linkKey":"browser-bridge"},{"id":"skill:codestable:cs","name":"Cs","slug":"cs","kind":"skill","summary":"CodeStable 入口。触发：用户调用 cs、想先讨论或对齐、想了解体系、问该用哪个 skill，或带着诉求未选入口。明确行动同轮直转；先讨论的请求收敛后同轮移交。","category":"Agent Skills","publisher":{"name":"codestable","verified":false,"provenance":"awesome-list-claim","url":"https://www.skills.sh/codestable/codestable/cs"},"stars":null,"version":null,"skillSource":"https://www.skills.sh/codestable/codestable/cs","installability":"discovery_only","source":"feed:skills-sh","linkKey":"cs"},{"id":"skill:codestable:cs-arch","name":"Cs Arch","slug":"cs-arch","kind":"skill","summary":"维护 `.codestable/architecture/` 这份只记现状的系统地图，三种模式 update / check / backfill。触发：用户说\"刷新 architecture\"、\"做架构检查\"、\"补这个模块的架构文档\"、\"方案和代码对得上吗\"，或 feature 阶段需要先做架构动作。不写未来规划（走 cs-roadmap）。","category":"Agent Skills","publisher":{"name":"codestable","verified":false,"provenance":"awesome-list-claim","url":"https://www.skills.sh/codestable/codestable/cs-arch"},"stars":null,"version":null,"skillSource":"https://www.skills.sh/codestable/codestable/cs-arch","installability":"discovery_only","source":"feed:skills-sh","linkKey":"cs-arch"},{"id":"skill:codestable:cs-audit","name":"Cs Audit","slug":"cs-audit","kind":"skill","summary":"系统审计。触发：审查系统、扫描 bug/安全/性能/架构债，产出发现清单。不要用于审查单次改动 diff(cs-code-review)、修已知 bug(cs-issue)、实现功能(cs-feat)、行为等价重构(cs-refactor)、沉淀已知经验(cs-keep)；这是仓库级只读投查，只发现不定修。","category":"Agent Skills","publisher":{"name":"codestable","verified":false,"provenance":"awesome-list-claim","url":"https://www.skills.sh/codestable/codestable/cs-audit"},"stars":null,"version":null,"skillSource":"https://www.skills.sh/codestable/codestable/cs-audit","installability":"discovery_only","source":"feed:skills-sh","linkKey":"cs-audit"},{"id":"skill:codestable:cs-brainstorm","name":"Cs Brainstorm","slug":"cs-brainstorm","kind":"skill","summary":"模糊想法分诊。触发：用户想先聊、brainstorm、方向摇摆；不处理 bug/重构。","category":"Agent Skills","publisher":{"name":"codestable","verified":false,"provenance":"awesome-list-claim","url":"https://www.skills.sh/codestable/codestable/cs-brainstorm"},"stars":null,"version":null,"skillSource":"https://www.skills.sh/codestable/codestable/cs-brainstorm","installability":"discovery_only","source":"feed:skills-sh","linkKey":"cs-brainstorm"},{"id":"skill:codestable:cs-decide","name":"Cs Decide","slug":"cs-decide","kind":"skill","summary":"把已拍板的技术选型、架构决定、长期约束、编码规约记成永久性决策文档（tech-stack / architecture / constraint / convention 四种）。触发：用户说\"记录决定\"、\"归档技术选型\"、\"ADR\"、\"记录这条约束\"、\"把规约写下来\"，或 design / analyze 后做出重要选择。只归档已拍板的，讨论中的不归档。","category":"Agent Skills","publisher":{"name":"codestable","verified":false,"provenance":"awesome-list-claim","url":"https://www.skills.sh/codestable/codestable/cs-decide"},"stars":null,"version":null,"skillSource":"https://www.skills.sh/codestable/codestable/cs-decide","installability":"discovery_only","source":"feed:skills-sh","linkKey":"cs-decide"},{"id":"skill:codestable:cs-explore","name":"Cs Explore","slug":"cs-explore","kind":"skill","summary":"对仓库做定向代码探索并把\"提问→读代码→得结论\"沉淀为可检索证据，三种类型 question / module-overview / spike。触发：用户说\"先 explore 一下\"、\"这个仓库里 X 怎么实现\"、\"快速熟悉这个模块\"、\"把探索结果存档\"。","category":"Agent Skills","publisher":{"name":"codestable","verified":false,"provenance":"awesome-list-claim","url":"https://www.skills.sh/codestable/codestable/cs-explore"},"stars":null,"version":null,"skillSource":"https://www.skills.sh/codestable/codestable/cs-explore","installability":"discovery_only","source":"feed:skills-sh","linkKey":"cs-explore"},{"id":"skill:codestable:cs-feat","name":"Cs Feat","slug":"cs-feat","kind":"skill","summary":"实现新功能或功能改造。不用于纯 bug 修复（cs-issue）、行为等价重构（cs-refactor）、大需求拆解（cs-epic）。","category":"Agent Skills","publisher":{"name":"codestable","verified":false,"provenance":"awesome-list-claim","url":"https://www.skills.sh/codestable/codestable/cs-feat"},"stars":null,"version":null,"skillSource":"https://www.skills.sh/codestable/codestable/cs-feat","installability":"discovery_only","source":"feed:skills-sh","linkKey":"cs-feat"},{"id":"skill:codestable:cs-feat-accept","name":"Cs Feat Accept","slug":"cs-feat-accept","kind":"skill","summary":"Deprecated 兼容入口：旧 cs-feat-accept 调用用；转交 cs-feat --stage accept。新请求不要主动选择。","category":"Agent Skills","publisher":{"name":"codestable","verified":false,"provenance":"awesome-list-claim","url":"https://www.skills.sh/codestable/codestable/cs-feat-accept"},"stars":null,"version":null,"skillSource":"https://www.skills.sh/codestable/codestable/cs-feat-accept","installability":"discovery_only","source":"feed:skills-sh","linkKey":"cs-feat-accept"},{"id":"skill:codestable:cs-feat-design","name":"Cs Feat Design","slug":"cs-feat-design","kind":"skill","summary":"Deprecated 兼容入口：旧 cs-feat-design 调用用；转交 cs-feat --stage design。新请求不要主动选择。","category":"Agent Skills","publisher":{"name":"codestable","verified":false,"provenance":"awesome-list-claim","url":"https://www.skills.sh/codestable/codestable/cs-feat-design"},"stars":null,"version":null,"skillSource":"https://www.skills.sh/codestable/codestable/cs-feat-design","installability":"discovery_only","source":"feed:skills-sh","linkKey":"cs-feat-design"},{"id